          "fill": "#333333",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Gather selected by user. Components are editable design candidates; no runtime action, permission, save or publication is performed. 48 px touch targets; visible labels, text + icon status, 2 px focus with 3 px offset; reduced motion removes travel. At compact sizes stack rows, preserve logical reading order and return focus. See catalogue for screen ownership, state variants and native mappings.",
