          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Cross-platform library state variants, 1280 × 1140. A01.create dates; A02/A03 capture; A05/A05.item import. Controls are simulated. A retained temporary recording is not a durable save. Denied permission does not start recording. Missing/unsupported candidates are not uploaded. Every branch retains an explicit safe return; full native keyboard and OS permission behavior require implementation checks.",
